      <p source="#source-699-722"><seg source="#source-699-722">一筆啓上仕候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-722-1045"><seg source="#source-722-737">然ニ先日御</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-737-764"><rb>直</rb><rt>（じきに）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-764-791">申上置候二件の御決</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-794-839"><seg source="#source-791-794">儀</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-815-824">（議）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-839-887">、何卒明朝より夜にかけ拝承仕度。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-887-908"><rb>将</rb><rt>（はた）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-908-1022">、芸州士官の者共も京師の急ニ心せき、出帆の日を相尋られ居申候。彼是の所御察被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1022-1034">レ</note><seg source="#source-1034-1045">遣候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1045-1143"><seg source="#source-1045-1048">早</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-1048-1081">〻</g><seg source="#source-1081-1143">御決の上、出帆の期御命相願候。誠恐謹言。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1143-1205" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1164-1205"><seg source="#source-1164-1179">九月廿七日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1179-1205" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1197-1205">直柔</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1205-1240" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p source="#source-1226-1240"><seg source="#source-1226-1240">本山先生</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1240-1267" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <p source="#source-1261-1267"><seg source="#source-1261-1267">左右</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
